---
<section class="frec-sec">
  <p class="frec-label">Frecuencia</p>
  <h2 class="frec-h2">CUÁNTO NECESITAS ENTRENAR</h2>
  <p class="frec-sub">Más días = mejores resultados. Pero incluso el mínimo genera cambios reales.</p>
  <div class="frec-grid">
    <div class="frec-cell">
      <p class="frec-num">3</p>
      <p class="frec-info">Días mínimo<br/>por semana</p>
      <p class="frec-tag">Punto de partida</p>
    </div>
    <div class="frec-cell highlight">
      <p class="frec-num big">5</p>
      <p class="frec-info">Días ideales<br/>por semana</p>
      <p class="frec-tag">Máximos resultados</p>
    </div>
    <div class="frec-cell">
      <p class="frec-num">50m</p>
      <p class="frec-info">Por sesión de<br/>entrenamiento</p>
      <p class="frec-tag">Intenso y enfocado</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .frec-sec {
    width: 100%;
    background: #0a0a0a;
    padding: clamp(48px, 7vw, 96px) clamp(20px, 6vw, 96px);
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }
  .frec-label {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #e5c178;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .frec-h2 {
    font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(28px, 5vw, 52px);
    line-height: 1;
    color: #fff;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .frec-sub {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.4);
    margin-bottom: 32px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .frec-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
    border-radius: 12px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .frec-cell {
    background: #0a0a0a;
    padding: clamp(20px, 4vw, 40px) 12px;
    text-align: center;
    border-right: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
  }
  .frec-cell:last-child { border-right: none; }
  .frec-cell.highlight {
    border-left: 1px solid rgba(229,193,120,0.25);
    border-right: 1px solid rgba(229,193,120,0.25);
  }
  .frec-num {
    font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(36px, 8vw, 64px);
    color: #e5c178;
    line-height: 1;
  }
  .frec-num.big {
    font-size: clamp(44px, 10vw, 80px);
  }
  .frec-info {
    font-size: clamp(9px, 2vw, 11px);
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.4);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    margin-top: 8px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .frec-tag {
    font-size: clamp(8px, 1.8vw, 10px);
    color: rgba(229,193,120,0.5);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    margin-top: 6px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .frec-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      border-radius: 12px;
    }
    .frec-cell {
      border-right: none;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
      padding: 24px 20px;
    }
    .frec-cell:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
    .frec-cell.highlight {
      border-left: none;
      border-right: none;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(229,193,120,0.25);
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(229,193,120,0.25);
    }
  }
</style>